48c\u4e86\u3067\u306f\u5168\u54e1\u304c\u305d\u3061\u3089\u3092\u898b\u307e\u3059\r\n\u30fb\u8d64\u30c9\u30e9\u3001\u55b0\u3044\u30bf\u30f3\u3001\u534a\u8358\uff0f\u6771\u98a8\u3092\u8a2d\u5b9a\u3067\u9078\u3079\u308b\u3088\u3046\u306b\u306a\u308a\u307e\u3057\u305f\r\n\r\n\u3010\u30a2\u30d7\u30ea\u5168\u4f53\u3011\r\n\u30fb\u6587\u5b57\u3092\u5168\u9762\u7684\u306b\u63cf\u304d\u76f4\u3057\u307e\u3057\u305f\u3002\u9060\u304f\u304b\u3089\u3067\u3082\u659c\u3081\u304b\u3089\u3067\u3082\u306b\u3058\u307f\u307e\u305b\u3093\r\n\u30fb\u5bfe\u5c40\u4e2d\u306e\u753b\u9762\u307e\u308f\u308a\u306e\u30c7\u30b6\u30a4\u30f3\u3092\u4e00\u65b0\u3057\u307e\u3057\u305f\r\n\u30fb\u724c\u306e\u63cf\u753b\u3092\u4f5c\u308a\u76f4\u3057\u3001\u5f15\u3063\u304b\u304b\u308a\u3092\u6e1b\u3089\u3057\u307e\u3057\u305f\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nMahjong has been rebuilt from the ground up.\r\n\r\n[Table and tiles]\r\n- Tiles are engraved ivory now, on a felt-and-timber automatic table\r\n- Tiles actually move: the deal, draws, discards, calls, the winning hand, the dora flip\r\n- New sounds for discards, shuffling and point sticks\r\n\r\n[Reading the hand]\r\n- Your waits and your furiten are always on screen\r\n- Point at a tile and see what you would be waiting on if you cut it\r\n- Every opponent's discards are mirrored onto one upright panel \u2014 no leaning over the table\r\n- Pon, chi, kan, riichi, ron and tsumo are called out, and a win reads its yaku one by one\r\n\r\n[How the table behaves]\r\n- The dice are thrown each hand, and the wall opens where they say\r\n- Point sticks are handed across the table\r\n- Opponents reach out to discard, and every head turns on a riichi or a win\r\n- Red fives, open tanyao and hanchan/east-only are now yours to set\r\n\r\n[Across the app]\r\n- All text has been redrawn: crisp from a distance and at an angle\r\n- The in-game panels have been redesigned\r\n- Tile rendering was rebuilt, so play stutters less", "created_date": 1788277676, "id": "164001493102711